{"id":"5103","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5103_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis-lacunosus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示的是在一个晴朗的日子，天顶处的卷积云。云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色，没有阴影</span>，由小元素组成。它具有整体透镜形状，说明是荚状云类，具有相当漫射的边缘。可以在图像的顶部详细地看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">具有小尺度蜂窝结构的网状云类</span>。可代表气流的探测表明云高约7000米。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰萨翁林纳","latitude":"纬度: 61° 52' 8'' N","longitude":"经度: 28° 53' 24'' E","date":"27 July 2008 0644 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.6"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5104_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis-lacunosus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这个放大的图像是一部分卷积云。它图解说明了网状云云类的典型结构，具有或多或少规则分布的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆孔，如网状或蜂窝状</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰萨翁林纳","latitude":"纬度: 61° 52' 14'' N","longitude":"经度: 28° 53' 28'' E","date":"27 July 2008 0645 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.6"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5103_syn_cirrocumulus-lenticularis-lacunosus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>北大西洋上现在为993 hPa的低压，北斯堪的纳维亚半岛的反气旋为1028 hPa。这张照片是在反气旋的东侧拍摄的。高层大气中存在偏北气流。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5625_main_irisation-in-cirrocumulus-lacunosus_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷积云</span>中呈现的颜色是虹彩所致。在太阳附近，当光波被大小一致的极小云粒子衍射时，会产生虹彩。与太阳形成的角度约大于10°时，光波干涉通常是主要因素。颜色通常以<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">绿色</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">粉色</span>为主，不过图中也可看到一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蓝色</span>。</p>\n<p>注意，为了充分记录这些柔和、淡雅的色调，照片有意曝光不足。实际上，图中的景象极为明亮 – 所以摄影师用楼顶基本遮挡住<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强烈的直射阳光</span>。卷积云呈白色，无暗影。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">7</span>上的小洞表明是网状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Claudia Hinz","location":"德国，巴伐利亚阿尔卑斯山脉，文德尔施泰因山","latitude":"纬度: 47° 42' 10'' N","longitude":"经度: 12° 0' 44'' E","date":"20 September 2007 1442 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.3 4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.3 4"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5095_main_cirrocumulus-with-undulatus-and-lacunosus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>该图像主要显示了卷积云，是根据其<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">非常小的元素</span>，表观宽度小于1°而确定的。 可以看到两个云种：起伏确定了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波状云</span>云种，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">清晰的小孔</span>看起来像一个网，可将其确定为网状云。右下角是一片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">成层卷积层</span>的边缘，而左边则是一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国巴特克罗伊茨纳赫县","latitude":"纬度: 49° 50' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 50' 32'' E","date":"07 December 2015 1424 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: S.2.6 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.2.6 1"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4489_main_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-lacunosus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>这片广阔的云幕因其纤细与洁白，属于卷积云属。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处可见无阴影的小圆云块，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处则可见波纹状结构。从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>处的众多孔洞可明显看出其网状结构。如同卷积云中常见的情况，部分卷云<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">fibratus</span>与云斑交织在一起。这片天空与缓慢从东北方过境的古老冷锋有关。该冷锋导致云量暂时增加，但未带来降水。</p></div>","copyright":"© A.J. Aalders","location":"Amsterdam, Netherlands","latitude":"纬度: 52° 22' 13'' N","longitude":"经度: 4° 53' 43'' E","date":"19 May 1952 1220 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}